            "fontcolor": "#000000",
            "fontname": "Calibri",
            "fontsize": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " refers to the proportion of EMR sites that submitted the most recent report i.e. The Jan 2020 overall reporting rate is the number of EMR sites that uploaded data to the NDW in Jan 2020 and so forth.",
          "style": {
            "fontcolor": "#000000",
            "fontname": "Calibri",
            "fontsize": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "style": {}
        },
        {
          "text": "PKVs = Patient Key Value",
          "style": {
            "bold": "true",
            "fontcolor": "#000000",
            "fontname": "Calibri",
            "fontsize": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is a concatenation of a patients Gender + Soundex value of Firstname​ + Double Metaphone value of Lastname​ + Date of Birth",
          "style": {
            "fontcolor": "#000000",
            "fontname": "Calibri",
            "fontsize": "10"
